case ok-version
desc the version command: one TBM line between two stock chat lines
module yes
send chat version
frame chat WHISPER_SELF .bot version
recv system TortoiseBots v0.1.0-forever
recv system TBM:VERSION|v0.1.0-forever
recv system TortoiseBots by Sagiroth, AGPL-3.0 or GPL-2.0+
expect hello.version v0.1.0-forever
expect hello.complete false
expect ignored.count 2
expect problems.count 0
